A few things may be causing the unpredictable actions:
The agent’s permissions may be broader than necessary.
The constraints may not clearly define prohibited actions.
Tool access may be enabled without specifying when each tool can be used.
There may be no confirmation step for sensitive or irreversible actions.
The agent may lack clear escalation rules when the request is ambiguous.
Goals may be too broad, allowing the agent to interpret them beyond the intended scope.
I’d first review permissions, tool access, constraints, and approval rules before redesigning the whole agent.
